  Slug: miraculous-spell
  DisplayName: Miraculous Spell
  IconPath: icons/magic/symbols/star-rising-purple.webp
  Description: You're exalted by your deity and gain truly incredible spells. You
    gain a single 10th-rank spell slot and can prepare a spell in that slot using
    cleric spellcasting. Unlike with other spell slots, you can't use 10-rank slots
    with abilities that give you more spell slots or that let you cast spells without
    expending spell slots. You don't gain more 10th-rank spells as you level up,
    but you can take the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Maker of Miracles]
    feat to gain a second slot.
